<title>USA: USFreightways unit gets Alberto-Culver contract.</title>
<headline>USFreightways unit gets Alberto-Culver contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONG GROVE, Ill. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Logix,  a subsidiary of USFreightways Corp, said on Monday its consumer products logistics unit Interamerican signed a five-year contract with Alberto-Culver Co.</p>
<p>Under the contract, Logix will manage a 235,000-square-foot distribution center in Ontario, Calif., and provide distribution and transportation services on the West Coast for Alberto-Culver.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
